[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12002.71, "timestamp": "03:20:02", "text": "我们心情无比愉悦。它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12005.75, "timestamp": "03:20:05", "text": "Jen Joang Long。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12008.71, "timestamp": "03:20:08", "text": "你的穿着打扮看起来不像本地人。你是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12011.75, "timestamp": "03:20:11", "text": "一个四处游荡的旅行者？四处游荡的旅行者？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12015.59, "timestamp": "03:20:15", "text": "有人回家了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12018.65, "timestamp": "03:20:18", "text": "呃，我不记得了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12022.15, "timestamp": "03:20:22", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12025.67, "timestamp": "03:20:25", "text": "所以，你不知道自己为什么会在这里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12030.59, "timestamp": "03:20:30", "text": "你来自哪里？或者你是谁？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12033.75, "timestamp": "03:20:33", "text": "是的。所以，你没告诉我们你会……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12037.229, "timestamp": "03:20:37", "text": "醒来后出现的这些后遗症"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12041.27, "timestamp": "03:20:41", "text": "向上。嗯。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12043.429, "timestamp": "03:20:43", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12046.07, "timestamp": "03:20:46", "text": "风给我们带来了警告。这"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12048.87, "timestamp": "03:20:48", "text": "电离层正在汇聚。这似乎是一种新的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12050.71, "timestamp": "03:20:50", "text": "酸性场正在形成。什么是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12054.309, "timestamp": "03:20:54", "text": "酸场？另外，这是我的盲打。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12056.229, "timestamp": "03:20:56", "text": "通过。顺便说一句，我以前从没看过"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12057.07, "timestamp": "03:20:57", "text": "任何"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12059.83, "timestamp": "03:20:59", "text": "视频。所以，是的，我忘了提了。"}]